恐縮ですが、何卒ご検討お願いします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1JEHkmxy606ZEjlhQ7RsPJxwswS-lm4mQ/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@genkidown/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1169, "client_id": 11175, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3cab7171/requests/222201_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=40ba4dd751a2ea3684fc5594de512267", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3cab7171/requests/222201_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=40ba4dd751a2ea3684fc5594de512267, https://si.imgix.net/3cab7171/requests/222201_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c7411c4eb7dc08a7349a61b4705db69e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3cab7171/requests/222201_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=abd107ccfd505597d6bbdf50a3c9d425 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3cab7171/requests/222201_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5599790461c3a8b7de20193dee2df8ad", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3cab7171/requests/222201_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5599790461c3a8b7de20193dee2df8ad, https://si.imgix.net/3cab7171/requests/222201_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=521ad403c1989ce1d5adcdcba9afd8ac 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3cab7171/requests/222201_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=94c5468e990074f612e27bcae30e595f 3x"}, "body": "サムライスピリッツのいろはをお願いできますか？\nゲンキダウンさんが時々お描きになるセクシーなイラストがとてもツボなので、宜しければ一枚お願いします。", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_sam